  "historyNote": "#2011, eff 5-4-82; amd by #2031, eff 5-11-82; ss by #2912, eff 11-26-84; ss by #4999, eff 11-26-90; ss by #6381, INTERIM, eff 11-27-96, EXPIRED: 3-27-97 New. #6605, eff 10-21-97, ss by #8448, eff 10-18-05; ss by #10603, eff 5-21-14; ss by #14106, eff 10-25-24, EXPIRES: 10-25-34 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Puc 300)",
